1
00:00:08,098 --> 00:00:09,255
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Madam.

2
00:00:10,514 --> 00:00:12,809
Ilvalla, ellige hogiddaare?

3
00:00:13,596 --> 00:00:15,727
Madam. Madam.

4
00:00:17,981 --> 00:00:20,900
Amma kaanisthilvalla, enaadlu?

5
00:00:21,335 --> 00:00:23,094
Elligaadroo hogiddaalaa?

6
00:00:26,599 --> 00:00:28,045
Phone manele ide.

7
00:00:28,666 --> 00:00:30,497
Lawn alli elladroo iddaaraa?

8
00:00:30,822 --> 00:00:33,707
SDH [Background Music]

9
00:00:34,094 --> 00:00:35,241
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Madam.

10
00:00:35,887 --> 00:00:37,030
Madam.

11
00:00:38,752 --> 00:00:39,776
Madam.

12
00:00:42,584 --> 00:00:43,597
Madam.

13
00:00:48,336 --> 00:00:51,988
Amma kaanisthilla giliyamma.
Ellaadroo kaansidlaa?

14
00:00:53,182 --> 00:00:55,142
Enaadroo helu giliyamma.

15
00:00:55,656 --> 00:00:59,130
Nanagoskara eno thagondu
bandiro thara ide. Enadu?

16
00:00:59,344 --> 00:01:02,108
SDH [Background Music]

17
00:01:07,121 --> 00:01:09,336
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Yaara photo giliyamma idu?

18
00:01:09,676 --> 00:01:11,472
Yaak thagondu bandiddiyaa?

19
00:01:12,185 --> 00:01:14,020
Neenu thagondu bandiddiyaa andre

20
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:16,741
khandithavaagloo eno kaarana idde iruthe.

21
00:01:17,215 --> 00:01:19,403
Modalu ee photo yaardu antha nodthini.

22
00:01:41,160 --> 00:01:43,542
SDH [Background Music]

23
00:01:51,006 --> 00:01:52,797
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Idanna yaak thagondu bande?

24
00:01:52,887 --> 00:01:54,446
Idu ninage elli sikthu?

25
00:01:59,295 --> 00:02:01,900
Ah... Giliyamma... Giliyamma...

26
00:02:05,529 --> 00:02:09,428
Giliyammange nanna hale
roopada photo hege sikthu?

27
00:02:10,461 --> 00:02:12,260
Yaara hathra sikthu?

28
00:02:13,236 --> 00:02:15,733
Nanna photona hidkondu
yaaru odaadthiddaare?

29
00:02:16,993 --> 00:02:19,188
Giliyamma haag bittuhoratu
hoythalla yaake?

30
00:02:19,299 --> 00:02:20,986
En nadeyutthe ashtakku?

31
00:02:23,407 --> 00:02:25,470
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Archana, enaaythu?

32
00:02:25,606 --> 00:02:27,137
Yaakilli bhayadalli ninthiddiyaa?

33
00:02:27,227 --> 00:02:29,155
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Amma kaanisthilla Gowramma.

34
00:02:29,245 --> 00:02:30,289
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Howda?

35
00:02:30,693 --> 00:02:32,944
Ellige hogiddaale? Neenu phone maadlillva?

36
00:02:33,034 --> 00:02:34,537
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Phone manele ide.

37
00:02:35,523 --> 00:02:38,620
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Horagade hogabeda
antha naanu pade pade heli hogidde.

38
00:02:39,024 --> 00:02:42,690
Adhoo alde,
thalenovthide antha nan hathra helidlu.

39
00:02:43,141 --> 00:02:44,786
Maththe eega ellige hodlu?

40
00:02:44,876 --> 00:02:46,704
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Ade artha aagthilla.

41
00:02:47,779 --> 00:02:49,241
Ashtralle giliyamma

42
00:02:49,331 --> 00:02:52,345
nanna asali roopada photona
thagondu bandu kottu hoythu.

43
00:02:52,506 --> 00:02:55,335
SDH [Background Music]

44
00:02:56,589 --> 00:02:59,588
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Idu adakke elli
hege sikthu gotthagthilla.

45
00:03:22,206 --> 00:03:25,793
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Nanna maathanna
kelde gere daati horatu hogiddaale.

46
00:03:25,930 --> 00:03:27,541
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Enaaythu Gowramma?

47
00:03:28,522 --> 00:03:30,056
En yochane maadthiddiyaa?

48
00:03:30,146 --> 00:03:32,659
Illi kappu bannada
gerena yaaru haakiddaare?

49
00:03:32,749 --> 00:03:35,012
Idarinda ammage enaadroo aagiruththa?

50
00:03:35,181 --> 00:03:36,924
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Neenenu bhaya padabeda.

51
00:03:37,869 --> 00:03:41,967
Nimmammanige yaavude reethi samasye
aagdiro haage naanu karkondu barthini.

52
00:03:42,513 --> 00:03:44,661
Neenu manele iru. Sarinaa?

53
00:03:44,783 --> 00:03:45,659
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Hmm.

54
00:03:45,789 --> 00:03:47,550
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Avani apaayadalliddaale.

55
00:03:48,977 --> 00:03:54,104
XXX

56
00:03:54,194 --> 00:03:58,904
XXX

57
00:04:04,018 --> 00:04:05,701
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Elliddiyaa amma?

58
00:04:09,857 --> 00:04:11,275
[ಗುರೂಜಿ] Alli. Alli nilsu.

59
00:04:22,107 --> 00:04:23,253
Aakade nadiri.

60
00:04:31,526 --> 00:04:33,867
[ಅವನಿ] Ee kaadina jaagakke
yaak karkondu bandri?

61
00:04:34,065 --> 00:04:36,922
[ಗುರೂಜಿ] Naanu heliro accident
ee jaagadalle nadedide.

62
00:04:39,239 --> 00:04:41,177
Nimma magalu olagade
obbara maneyalliddaale.

63
00:04:41,295 --> 00:04:43,256
Nimma magalige thumba hathiradalli iddeera.

64
00:04:45,616 --> 00:04:48,505
Amma amma antha eshtu
kanavaristhiddalo paapa.

65
00:04:49,207 --> 00:04:50,276
Banni amma.

66
00:05:03,585 --> 00:05:05,222
[ಅವನಿ] Manene kaanistha illa.

67
00:05:06,178 --> 00:05:08,498
Alla ee kaadina madhyadalli
mane irodu andre enu?

68
00:05:08,614 --> 00:05:11,375
[ಗುರೂಜಿ] Yaakirabaaradamma.
Thoristhini, banni.

69
00:05:11,642 --> 00:05:13,879
Hathiradalle iddivi naavu. Banni amma.

70
00:05:14,032 --> 00:05:16,917
SDH [Background Music]

71
00:05:36,104 --> 00:05:38,109
[ಗುರೂಜಿ] Ninna magalu
entha muddagiddaalamma.

72
00:05:39,459 --> 00:05:41,483
Ammanavara amshadalli huttiro haage

73
00:05:41,597 --> 00:05:43,748
avala mukha thumba kalakaliyaagide amma.

74
00:05:43,838 --> 00:05:47,233
[ಅವನಿ] Howdu ree.
Nanna magaladu adrushta jaathaka.

75
00:05:47,364 --> 00:05:50,779
Avalua kaarana janmalu.
Ammanavara amshadondige huttiddaale.

76
00:05:50,869 --> 00:05:51,786
[ಗುರೂಜಿ] Howda?

77
00:05:52,408 --> 00:05:53,930
Adrushtavanthalu thaayi.

78
00:06:02,204 --> 00:06:03,844
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Amma innoo bandilla.

79
00:06:03,934 --> 00:06:06,631
Amman bagge bhayapadabeda antha heli hoda

80
00:06:06,721 --> 00:06:08,803
Gowramma kooda innoo bandilla.

81
00:06:13,018 --> 00:06:16,330
Appan hathra vishaya
heli avara help thogobeku.

82
00:06:24,702 --> 00:06:25,711
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Sir!

83
00:06:29,999 --> 00:06:30,801
[ಶೇಖರ್] Eno?

84
00:06:30,891 --> 00:06:32,787
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Avani madam bagge maathadabeku.

85
00:06:32,925 --> 00:06:36,360
[ಶೇಖರ್] Eno personal work iddu office
ge barakkagthilla antha leave haakiddaale.

86
00:06:36,514 --> 00:06:38,022
Ivaga avani bagge enu maathadabeku?

87
00:06:38,136 --> 00:06:41,800
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Avani madamge thumba
thale novthide antha leave haakidru.

88
00:06:42,705 --> 00:06:45,880
Aa samayadalli naanu Sujatha
avaru horagade hogidvi.

89
00:06:46,005 --> 00:06:47,708
Namma maneliru Gowramma kooda

90
00:06:47,798 --> 00:06:50,148
yaavudo kelasa ide antha horage hogidlu.

91
00:06:50,855 --> 00:06:53,841
Manege bandu nodidre, madam kaanisthilla.

92
00:06:53,957 --> 00:06:55,265
Bhaya aagthide sir.

93
00:06:55,384 --> 00:06:56,616
[ಶೇಖರ್] Yaak bhayapadodu?

94
00:06:56,804 --> 00:06:58,055
Medical shop ge enaadroo hogiddaalenoo.

95
00:06:58,145 --> 00:06:59,273
Ondsala phone maadi nodu.

96
00:06:59,363 --> 00:07:00,745
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Phone manele ide.

97
00:07:00,835 --> 00:07:03,764
Horagade hodre phone
thagondu hogdene irodilla.

98
00:07:04,562 --> 00:07:06,961
[ಶೇಖರ್] Pakkada maneyalli
enaadroo iddaalenoo? Check maadoddiyaa?

99
00:07:07,245 --> 00:07:10,224
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Akka pakka
iddee beedine hudukde sir.

100
00:07:11,469 --> 00:07:13,096
Madam avaru enaadru...

101
00:07:13,186 --> 00:07:16,592
Madamge enaagidyo antha
thumba bhaya aagthide sir.

102
00:07:17,251 --> 00:07:20,459
Haage horagade nodkondu barona,
nanna jothege barthira sir?

103
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:24,808
Kaanisde hogirodo nanage ammananthavalu.

104
00:07:24,898 --> 00:07:26,572
Nanage ishtu bhaya aagthide.

105
00:07:26,722 --> 00:07:28,897
Maththe neevu thaali kattirodu hendthi.

106
00:07:29,012 --> 00:07:31,382
Neevu yaake yochane maadthiddeeraa sir?

107
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:37,359
Thali bandhana ulisikollodakkoskara
avaru thumba kashta padthiddaare.

108
00:07:37,495 --> 00:07:40,644
Neevu maathra sambandha
illada haage irthiddeeraa.

109
00:07:42,727 --> 00:07:44,426
Dayavittu banni sir.

110
00:07:45,425 --> 00:07:47,163
[ಶೇಖರ್] Sari. Nadi.

111
00:07:47,564 --> 00:07:48,913
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Thank you sir.

112
00:07:54,509 --> 00:07:55,429
[ಸುಜಾತ] Shekhar.

113
00:07:55,693 --> 00:07:58,345
SDH [Background Music]

114
00:08:00,267 --> 00:08:01,170
[ಸುಜಾತ] Iliye.

115
00:08:03,518 --> 00:08:05,382
[ಶೇಖರ್] Amma, enaythu antha...

116
00:08:05,472 --> 00:08:06,989
[ಸುಜಾತ] Nanella keliskonde kano.

117
00:08:07,682 --> 00:08:09,326
Ey, neenu iliye.

118
00:08:10,930 --> 00:08:12,554
Helthiroddu ninage, kelagiliye.

119
00:08:16,977 --> 00:08:18,110
[ಜಟ] Jai Chata.

120
00:08:18,200 --> 00:08:20,215
Avani, naan heldage maadu.

121
00:08:29,023 --> 00:08:32,305
[ಮಾಯಾ] Taaligiro shakti,
kshudra shakti munde

122
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:35,075
solodakke siddha aagutte.

123
00:08:37,784 --> 00:08:43,439
Avani aatma,
deha, buddhi ellaa swami adheena.

124
00:08:44,453 --> 00:08:46,986
Innu taali thegiyode thada.

125
00:08:51,756 --> 00:08:52,834
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Ajji

126
00:08:53,059 --> 00:08:54,622
Amma kaanisthilla.

127
00:08:54,712 --> 00:08:57,478
Ammana hudukabeku. Sarna kalsi.

128
00:08:57,568 --> 00:08:58,727
[ಸುಜಾತ] Baay mucche.

129
00:09:00,373 --> 00:09:04,361
Ninaginnu svalpa salige kottre
nanna ajji antha kareda haage,

130
00:09:04,800 --> 00:09:09,501
ava ninna amma antha kareda haage nanna
magana appa antha kooda kariyo haagidya?

131
00:09:12,527 --> 00:09:17,172
Nanna aa reethi kariyo arhathe
ninagilla antha avatthe helideenalle.

132
00:09:18,575 --> 00:09:21,459
Yey. Neenu ivala maatugalanna nambabeda.

133
00:09:22,925 --> 00:09:26,941
Aa Avanina, ninna ondu maadodakke
ivlu naataka maadtiddaale.

134
00:09:29,634 --> 00:09:33,449
Ee madhye ivlu kaanistilla
antha avanige bandu kelidlu.

135
00:09:33,617 --> 00:09:37,083
Ivaaga avanige kaanistilla
antha ivlu bandu keltiddaale.

136
00:09:39,069 --> 00:09:43,490
Avattu raatri ella maaya
aagi hogi belaggene aaraamagi bande.

137
00:09:43,698 --> 00:09:46,406
Raatri ella ellige hogidde? Ellidde?

138
00:09:46,496 --> 00:09:49,870
SDH [Background Music]

139
00:09:50,434 --> 00:09:53,161
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Neenu aa Mayegoskara
kaadige bandiro vishyana

140
00:09:53,251 --> 00:09:54,943
nimma madamge helabeda.

141
00:09:55,075 --> 00:09:56,396
Bhayapadthaare.

142
00:09:57,311 --> 00:10:01,115
Neenu inmundhe naanu
helid reethenalle nadkobeku.

143
00:10:01,205 --> 00:10:03,073
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Maya guttrat maadodakke...

144
00:10:03,180 --> 00:10:05,305
kaadige hogiro vishaya hellokaagalla,

145
00:10:05,429 --> 00:10:09,078
yaakandre naanu gowramman
maathige bele kodabeku.

146
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:10,700
[ಸುಜಾತ] Yaake enu helthilla?

147
00:10:11,627 --> 00:10:14,369
Aa avani haage sullu helbeda.
Nija helu.

148
00:10:14,565 --> 00:10:16,515
[ಅರ್ಚನಾ] Madam yaavaththoo sullu helalla.

149
00:10:16,605 --> 00:10:19,032
[ಸುಜಾತ] Avala bagge namage
neene helabeku maththe.

150
00:10:19,612 --> 00:10:20,610
[ಸಿದು] Archana.

151
00:10:21,055 --> 00:10:23,448
Amma keltha irodakke
neenu yaake uttara kodtilla?

152
00:10:23,578 --> 00:10:24,760
[ಸುಜಾತ] Helalvo,

153
00:10:24,928 --> 00:10:26,969
ivala hathra maamooli marma illa.

154
00:10:27,059 --> 00:10:29,430
Maya ee manege soseyaagi barabaaradu,

155
00:10:29,553 --> 00:10:31,692
Avani vaapas ee manege kaal idabeku,

156
00:10:31,782 --> 00:10:34,719
aa mane anna thinthiro
vishvaasa thorisikobeku.

157
00:10:34,987 --> 00:10:36,445
Ide ivala guri.

158
00:10:37,949 --> 00:10:39,735
Avanige enu aagiralla.

159
00:10:39,825 --> 00:10:41,502
Avalu swalpa hoththalle barthaale.

160
00:10:41,609 --> 00:10:43,775
Ibbaru seri naataka maadthiddare.

161
00:10:44,036 --> 00:10:46,905
Idea avaladu, aacharane ivaladu.

162
00:10:48,062 --> 00:10:49,466
Mahanatiyaru.

163
00:10:50,660 --> 00:10:52,213
Neenu ivala maathanna nambabeda.

164
00:10:52,303 --> 00:10:53,975
Avani bagge yochane maadabeda.

165
00:10:55,308 --> 00:10:56,298
Neenu baaro.

166
00:11:03,935 --> 00:11:06,398
SDH [Background Music]

167
00:11:13,673 --> 00:11:15,270
[ಅಜ್ಞಾತ ಪುರುಷ] Enaaythamma yaak ninthbitte?

168
00:11:15,389 --> 00:11:16,420
[ಅವನಿ] Yaar neenu?

169
00:11:17,551 --> 00:11:19,692
Ee kaadige nannannu yaak karkondu bande?

170
00:11:21,394 --> 00:11:24,450
Nijavaaglu nanna magaligoskara
neenu karkondu bandya?

171
00:11:25,976 --> 00:11:29,411
Magalanna adda itkondu
nanna ishtu doora kareskondya?

172
00:11:29,501 --> 00:11:32,262
[ಅಜ್ಞಾತ ಪುರುಷ] Illamma,
ninna magaligoskarane karkondu bande.

173
00:11:33,147 --> 00:11:35,539
[ಅವನಿ] Nanage ninna maathina
mele nambike bartha illa.

174
00:11:36,359 --> 00:11:39,452
Alligu nanna maneyalli
iddaga Gowramma helthaane idlu.

175
00:11:39,598 --> 00:11:42,252
Horagade hogabeda,
gottillade iroranna nambabeda antha.

176
00:11:43,473 --> 00:11:47,034
Naanu maathu kelalilla.
Ninna kurudi thara nambi ishtu doora bande.

177
00:11:51,870 --> 00:11:53,333
[ಜಟ] Jai Chata.

178
00:11:54,449 --> 00:11:57,725
SDH [Background Music]

179
00:12:13,551 --> 00:12:16,144
[ಜಟ] Eega neenu nanna adheenadalliddeeya.

180
00:12:16,995 --> 00:12:19,310
Naanu heldaage kelthiya?

181
00:12:21,216 --> 00:12:23,863
Naanu heldaage nadkothiya?

182
00:12:25,193 --> 00:12:26,210
Baa.

183
00:12:31,369 --> 00:12:34,295
[ವೃದ್ಧ ವ್ಯಕ್ತಿ] Alla nodi,
swami avanina karkondu barthiddare.

184
00:12:44,296 --> 00:12:46,786
[ಜಟ]  Nimmellarigoo kotta maathina prakara

185
00:12:46,876 --> 00:12:48,412
Avanina karkondu bandiddini.

186
00:12:49,631 --> 00:12:53,277
[ಮನುಷ್ಯ] Neevu helida mele yaava
kaaryanadru nadede ne irutthe heli.

187
00:12:53,385 --> 00:12:57,117
[ಜಟ] Namage ee avanindale
hejje hejjigu samasye barthide.

188
00:12:58,848 --> 00:13:02,710
Thakshana poojena shuru maadthini.
Mantra helthini.

189
00:13:03,499 --> 00:13:07,006
Avani thanna maangalyakke iro
shakthinellaa kalekollu haage maadthini.

190
00:13:08,463 --> 00:13:14,130
Aamele avalaagi avale mangalasootrana
koralinda thegiyo haage maadthini.

191
00:13:15,691 --> 00:13:18,057
Avani, eega neenu nanna adheenadalliddiyaa.

192
00:13:18,255 --> 00:13:20,433
Adakke ankondiroದು nadeyovaregu

193
00:13:20,523 --> 00:13:23,217
nanna maathige eduruttara, addi baralla.

194
00:13:24,626 --> 00:13:28,890
Avani, poojena shuru maadona. Kootko.

195
00:13:29,069 --> 00:13:30,234
[ಅವನಿ] Aagli swami.

196
00:13:30,687 --> 00:13:34,221
SDH [Background Music]

197
00:14:03,511 --> 00:14:06,257
SDH [Background Music]

198
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:26,233
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Naanu rekhena haaki

199
00:14:26,323 --> 00:14:29,481
avanige rakshane maadabeku
antha eshte prayathnisidru

200
00:14:29,616 --> 00:14:33,509
aa maanthrika thanna yukthiyinda
avanina apaharisiddaane.

201
00:14:35,614 --> 00:14:40,215
Aa dushtara attahaasa nanna bhakthara
mele dina dinakke mithi meeruththide.

202
00:14:40,709 --> 00:14:45,731
Adakke avara mele naanu yuddhana
prakatisabekagiro samaya haththira bandide.

203
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:50,889
Avanige thondare kodabeku
antha nodthiro aa maanthrikanna

204
00:14:51,150 --> 00:14:52,782
naanu anthya maadthini.

205
00:14:53,088 --> 00:14:56,264
SDH [Background Music]

206
00:15:24,188 --> 00:15:29,196
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Avani, ninage chikka haani
kooda aagdiro haage naanu kaapaadkotheeni.

207
00:15:29,366 --> 00:15:32,854
SDH [Background Music]

208
00:16:35,861 --> 00:16:37,027
Ninthko.

209
00:16:45,863 --> 00:16:47,272
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Amma thaayi...

210
00:16:47,406 --> 00:16:49,704
Adiparashakti, Jaganmathe.

211
00:16:50,947 --> 00:16:53,789
Neenu prathyaksha aagodakke
kaarana enu thaayi?

212
00:16:53,924 --> 00:16:57,431
[ದೇವತೆ] Neenu eega maanava
roopadalliro ammanavaru.

213
00:16:59,251 --> 00:17:02,801
Maanavara jothe seri
odaadtha iro daiva roopa.

214
00:17:04,483 --> 00:17:09,651
Obba bhakthena, avala magalanna
kaapaadodakke hogironthavalu.

215
00:17:11,947 --> 00:17:16,220
Aadroo ninage ee bhoolokadalli
kelavu niyamagalive.

216
00:17:17,214 --> 00:17:19,291
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Niyamagala? Nanaga?

217
00:17:19,511 --> 00:17:22,383
[ದೇವತೆ] Maanava roopadalli
sancharisutthiro ninage

218
00:17:22,908 --> 00:17:25,370
kelavu shaktigalu maathrane irodu.

219
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:30,639
Kelavu kaaryagalannane maadabahudu.

220
00:17:32,997 --> 00:17:37,724
Ninna shaktina atyantha apayada
samayadalli upayogisabeke horathu

221
00:17:38,084 --> 00:17:41,321
manasso ichhe adanna upayogisabaaradu.

222
00:17:43,600 --> 00:17:48,121
Kelavu sandarbhagalalli maanavare
avarige eduraada kashtadinda,

223
00:17:48,211 --> 00:17:51,086
nashtadinda paaragoke prayathna maadabeku.

224
00:17:51,868 --> 00:17:53,752
Avare saadhisabeku.

225
00:17:56,674 --> 00:17:59,764
Naavu avarige kashtana eduriso shaktina,

226
00:17:59,974 --> 00:18:02,461
dhairyana prasaadhisabeke horathu

227
00:18:02,791 --> 00:18:07,590
prathi kashtanu naave theerisabeku
ankolloodu moorkhathana aagutthe.

228
00:18:09,586 --> 00:18:13,141
Bhakthe mele vipareethavaada
preethina belesikondu,

229
00:18:13,403 --> 00:18:17,938
ayudha hidkondu shatruna
anthya maadodakke hogtha iddiya,

230
00:18:18,085 --> 00:18:20,105
idu avasarada kelasa.

231
00:18:20,312 --> 00:18:21,433
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Yaake thaayi?

232
00:18:21,564 --> 00:18:25,172
[ದೇವತೆ] Daiva yaavagaalu
loka kalyaanakoskara horaadabeku.

233
00:18:25,526 --> 00:18:29,318
Bhakthara meliro vyakthika
preethigoskara horaadabaaradu.

234
00:18:29,845 --> 00:18:32,589
Aaga maanava janmakke artha enirutthe?

235
00:18:34,614 --> 00:18:38,048
Adakke, eega neenu enu maadokaagalla.

236
00:18:38,434 --> 00:18:40,457
Ninna shakti kelasa maadodilla.

237
00:18:40,566 --> 00:18:43,673
SDH [Background Music]

238
00:18:43,929 --> 00:18:45,785
[ದೇವತೆ] Nindu vyartha prayatna.

239
00:18:46,225 --> 00:18:50,266
Raama, Krishna kooda
maanava roopadalli iddaga

240
00:18:50,471 --> 00:18:52,476
svalpa mattige maathra maadokaaytu.

241
00:18:52,566 --> 00:18:57,413
Adakke saadhyavaadashtu bega
bhoolokadalli ninna kelasana muguskondu

242
00:18:57,503 --> 00:18:59,459
namma lokakke hindirugi baa.

243
00:18:59,826 --> 00:19:02,572
Innu neeniga hejje munde idokaagalla.

244
00:19:07,709 --> 00:19:10,618
[ಗೌರಮ್ಮ] Eega nanna bhakthena
naanu hege kaapaadodu?

245
00:19:11,325 --> 00:19:14,393
Alli avani paristhithi
eno nanage artha aagthilla.

246
00:19:17,911 --> 00:19:20,628
